"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに書いたこと全て、ノンフィクションです。\nこれからも嘘のないアイドルでいるんだから！\nこれからもよろしくね〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなまた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#nanamiblog"}],"source":"official"}}